      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFD27A>READ THE SEA</color>\n\u2022 <color=#7FE8FF>Jellyfish blooms</color> drift with the current: follow the gap\n\u2022 <color=#7FE8FF>Turtles</color> only block you when they surface to breathe\n\u2022 <color=#7FE8FF>Dolphins</color> are harmless mid-leap, solid between leaps\n\u2022 <color=#7FE8FF>Orcas</color>: fins along the edge, then the pod charges across\n\u2022 A <color=#7FE8FF>ring of bubbles</color>? A humpback is about to lunge up: get out!\n\u2022 Orb <color=#FFD27A>combos</color>, near misses and the <color=#FFD27A>golden star</color> score big"
